Fluxtion-Requires: MidApi, DepthApi
Fluxtion-Constructor: (MidApi, DepthApi)
Fluxtion-Consumes: Rate
Fluxtion-Description: adds the spread including the desk hedging overlay; owns the RATE event
Fluxtion-Convention: spread=hedged

Name: com/vendor/pricing/PricingNetted.class
Fluxtion-Entry-Point: true
Fluxtion-Provides: adjusted=AdjustedApi, spread=SpreadApi
Fluxtion-Requires: MidApi, DepthApi
Fluxtion-Constructor: (MidApi, DepthApi)
Fluxtion-Consumes: Rate
Fluxtion-Description: adds the spread net of the standing inventory offset; owns the RATE event
Fluxtion-Convention: spread=netted

Name: com/vendor/pricing/PricingGross.class
Fluxtion-Entry-Point: true
Fluxtion-Provides: adjusted=AdjustedApi, spread=SpreadApi
