Fluxtion-Constructor: (MidApi, DepthApi)
Fluxtion-Consumes: Rate
Fluxtion-Description: adds the spread gross of execution fees; owns the RATE event
Fluxtion-Convention: spread=gross

Name: com/vendor/pricing/PricingCapped.class
